kground":68},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$9820063f-3b72-4ae4-b5a4-ab04ba54d50e","international_hero_banner",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":73,"primary":75,"id":94,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[74],{},{"CardImage":76,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":84,"CardText":85,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":46,"copyright":46,"url":80,"id":81,"edit":82},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,670,"romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2Vk9JbqstJ98ut-_Romania.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z2Vk9JbqstJ98ut-",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"none","Postage to Romania with Evri",[86,91],{"type":87,"text":88,"spans":89,"direction":90},"paragraph","Over 1,000 miles from the UK, parcels to Romania have a long way to travel! That’s why you need an international courier service you can rely on.",[],"ltr",{"type":87,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":90},"With Evri, you can send a parcel to Romania from the UK in 11-14 days. Plus, you’ll get full tracking and up to £20 free parcel cover included as standard. This means you can keep track of your items throughout their journey with peace of mind.",[],"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":97,"version":31,"items":98,"primary":114,"id":123,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[99,102,105,108,111],{"Col1Content":100,"Col2Content":101},"250g","£12.69",{"Col1Content":103,"Col2Content":104},"500g","£13.49",{"Col1Content":106,"Col2Content":107},"1kg","£14.69",{"Col1Content":109,"Col2Content":110},"2kg","£17.29",{"Col1Content":112,"Col2Content":113},"5kg+","£37.49",{"SectionTitle":115,"SectionSubtitle":116,"Col1Header":117,"Col2Header":118,"InformationTableButtonUrl":119,"InformationTableButtonText":122,"isTableShort":20},"How much is shipping to Romania?","When you send a parcel to Romania with Evri, you get a great courier service at a low price. You can send parcels internationally up to 15kg. See how cheap it is based on some of our more popular parcel weights:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":120,"url":121},"801288fc-8b8a-4f95-bfd0-10ba228a8215","romania.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Romania","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":126,"primary":128,"id":166,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},[127],{},{"CardImage":129,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":136,"CardText":137,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":130,"alt":46,"copyright":46,"url":132,"id":133,"edit":134},{"width":78,"height":131},665,"romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7S8LZ7c43Q3f75A_Customsdeclaration.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C5760%2C3830&w=1000&h=665","Z7S8LZ7c43Q3f75A",{"x":66,"y":135,"zoom":67,"background":68},5,"Romania customs update: £4.50 handling fee",[138,147,150,154,157,160,163],{"type":87,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":90},"From 25 February 2026, a £4.50 handling fee will apply to some parcels delivered to Romania. ",[141,144],{"start":135,"end":142,"type":143},21,"strong",{"start":145,"end":146,"type":143},25,43,{"type":87,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":90},"The fee applies to: ",[],{"type":151,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":90},"list-item","Items sold to customers (B2C) ",[],{"type":151,"text":155,"spans":156,"direction":90},"Goods sent from outside the EU ",[],{"type":151,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":90},"Parcels worth under €150 ",[],{"type":151,"text":161,"spans":162,"direction":90},"Parcels delivered to an address in Romania ",[],{"type":87,"text":164,"spans":165,"direction":90},"The fee is based on where the parcel is delivered. Our local delivery partner will collect it and pass it to the Romanian authorities. ",[],"card$06526745-5be7-427c-bdb0-1e713db8dfb7",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":169,"primary":170,"id":255,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":171,"CardText":172,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":253,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in Romania",[173,176,181,185,190,195,199,204,209,214,219,224,229,234,238,242,246,250],{"type":87,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":90},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":151,"text":177,"spans":178,"direction":90},"New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[179],{"start":66,"end":180,"type":143},14,{"type":151,"text":182,"spans":183,"direction":90},"Day after New Year's Day – 02\u002F01\u002F2026",[184],{"start":66,"end":61,"type":143},{"type":151,"text":186,"spans":187,"direction":90},"Epiphany – 06\u002F01\u002F2026",[188],{"start":66,"end":189,"type":143},8,{"type":151,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":90},"Synaxis of St. John the Baptist - 07\u002F01\u002F2026",[193],{"start":66,"end":194,"type":143},31,{"type":151,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":90},"Unification Day – 24\u002F01\u002F2026",[198],{"start":66,"end":180,"type":143},{"type":151,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":90},"Orthodox Good Friday – 10\u002F04\u002F2026",[202],{"start":66,"end":203,"type":143},20,{"type":151,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":90},"Orthodox Easter Monday – 13\u002F04\u002F2026",[207],{"start":66,"end":208,"type":143},22,{"type":151,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":90},"Labour Day – 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[212],{"start":66,"end":213,"type":143},11,{"type":151,"text":215,"spans":216,"direction":90},"Orthodox Whit Monday - 01\u002F06\u002F2026",[217],{"start":66,"end":218,"type":143},23,{"type":151,"text":220,"spans":221,"direction":90},"Children's Day - 01\u002F06\u002F2026",[222],{"start":66,"end":223,"type":143},15,{"type":151,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":90},"St Mary's Day - 15\u002F08\u002F2026",[227],{"start":66,"end":228,"type":143},13,{"type":151,"text":230,"spans":231,"direction":90},"St Andrew's Day - 30\u002F11\u002F2026",[232],{"start":66,"end":233,"type":143},16,{"type":151,"text":235,"spans":236,"direction":90},"National Day - 01\u002F12\u002F2026",[237],{"start":66,"end":228,"type":143},{"type":151,"text":239,"spans":240,"direction":90},"Great Union Day – 01\u002F12\u002F2026",[241],{"start":66,"end":223,"type":143},{"type":151,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":90},"Christmas – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[245],{"start":66,"end":213,"type":143},{"type":151,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":90},"Second day of Christmas - 26\u002F12\u002F2026",[249],{"start":66,"end":218,"type":143},{"type":87,"text":251,"spans":252,"direction":90},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":254},"Any","card$61802ea6-bcf0-45a8-a089-b6e925860ec1",{"variation":257,"version":31,"items":258,"primary":320,"id":330,"slice_type":331,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[259,280,300],{"Title":260,"Description":265,"Image":269,"Label":46,"UrlText":263,"Url":276,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":279,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[261],{"type":262,"text":263,"spans":264},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[266],{"type":87,"text":267,"spans":268,"direction":90},"Book your parcel online and drop off at 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. No printer? No problem. Use our free Print in ParcelShop devices to print your label in-store. You can also find us in selected Post Offices where you can book your delivery in person.",[],{"dimensions":270,"alt":272,"copyright":46,"url":273,"id":274,"edit":275},{"width":78,"height":271},667,"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":277,"url":278},"ef647dac-2503-4312-9852-fcaea36a7125","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":254},{"Title":281,"Description":285,"Image":289,"Label":46,"UrlText":283,"Url":296,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":299,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[282],{"type":262,"text":283,"spans":284},"Lockers",[],[286],{"type":87,"text":287,"spans":288,"direction":90},"Book online, print your label and drop off at a Locker in your area, all open 24\u002F7. All you need to do is scan your barcode on arrive and place your parcel inside an available Locker, ready for us to collect.",[],{"dimensions":290,"alt":291,"copyright":46,"url":292,"id":293,"edit":294},{"width":78,"height":271},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":295,"zoom":67,"background":68},9,{"link_type":36,"key":297,"url":298},"5e8a5f18-a8e3-4933-a109-60e6021b6722","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":254},{"Title":301,"Description":305,"Image":309,"Label":46,"UrlText":315,"Url":316,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":319,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[302],{"type":262,"text":303,"spans":304},"Couriers",[],[306],{"type":87,"text":307,"spans":308,"direction":90},"Go online and book a courier collection straight from your home or office. Choose a day that suits you, and we'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us to arrive.",[],{"dimensions":310,"alt":311,"copyright":46,"url":312,"id":313,"edit":314},{"width":78,"height":271},"An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared.","romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdKZbqstJ9-inz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8362.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdKZbqstJ9-inz",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":317,"url":318},"a33205e2-8aa8-472a-9e9b-9cf59ad767d3","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":254},{"SectionTitle":321,"SectionDescription":326,"theme":46},[322],{"type":323,"text":324,"spans":325},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Romania",[],[327],{"type":87,"text":328,"spans":329},"Choose from three options when sending a parcel to Romania from the UK with Evri. ",[],"article_link_module$ecb6c537-2655-419e-967f-7a1caed6ee28","article_link_module",{"variation":333,"version":31,"items":334,"primary":336,"id":362,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[335],{},{"CardImage":337,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":344,"CardText":345,"ButtonText":359,"ButtonUrl":360,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":338,"alt":339,"copyright":46,"url":340,"id":341,"edit":342},{"width":78,"height":271},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc",{"x":343,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},47,"Send multiple parcels to Romania",[346,349,353,356],{"type":87,"text":347,"spans":348,"direction":90},"If you run a business or have multiple packages to send at once, our bulk integrations tool makes it quicker and easier to book and manage your parcels in one go. ",[],{"type":350,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":90},"o-list-item","Log in to your Evri account on our sister site and link your marketplace seller’s account - eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or another platform. You can also upload parcels via CSV file.",[],{"type":350,"text":354,"spans":355,"direction":90},"Pack your items, book online, then print your postage label at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop device. ",[],{"type":350,"text":357,"spans":358,"direction":90},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or arrange for a courier collection.",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":361,"url":38},"34e711af-8bb1-40c7-bbf0-83901e0fd261","card$8c318b82-0c9d-47b4-bc05-d2e020d5d660",{"variation":364,"version":31,"items":365,"primary":447,"id":450,"slice_type":451,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[366,387,399,411,423,435],{"title":367,"content":368,"icon":380},"Regular tracking updates",[369],{"type":87,"text":370,"spans":371,"direction":90},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[372,379],{"start":373,"end":374,"type":375,"data":376},55,63,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":377,"target":378},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":373,"end":374,"type":143},{"dimensions":381,"alt":383,"copyright":46,"url":384,"id":385,"edit":386},{"width":382,"height":382},40,"Phone icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":388,"content":389,"icon":393},"Parcel cover",[390],{"type":87,"text":391,"spans":392,"direction":90},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":394,"alt":395,"copyright":46,"url":396,"id":397,"edit":398},{"width":382,"height":382},"Money icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":400,"content":401,"icon":405},"Customs made easier",[402],{"type":87,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":90},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":406,"alt":407,"copyright":46,"url":408,"id":409,"edit":410},{"width":382,"height":382},"Passport icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":412,"content":413,"icon":417},"Flexible printing options",[414],{"type":87,"text":415,"spans":416,"direction":90},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":418,"alt":419,"copyright":46,"url":420,"id":421,"edit":422},{"width":382,"height":382},"Printer icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":424,"content":425,"icon":429},"Bulk send",[426],{"type":87,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":90},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":430,"alt":431,"copyright":46,"url":432,"id":433,"edit":434},{"width":382,"height":382},"Laptop icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":436,"content":437,"icon":441},"Trusted by top UK brands",[438],{"type":87,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":90},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":442,"alt":443,"copyright":46,"url":444,"id":445,"edit":446},{"width":382,"height":382},"Success icon","romania.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":448,"title":449,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to Romania with Evri?","list_block$2eadb260-ebb8-4088-8f04-22734a0b35f7","list_block",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":453,"primary":455,"id":481,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},[454],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":456,"CardText":457,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":480,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Romania?",[458,466],{"type":87,"text":459,"spans":460,"direction":90},"When you use Evri, you can send lots of different things across the world, but there are a few limitations. You’ll find a breakdown of what you can and can’t send to Romania or anywhere else on our prohibited items list. ",[461,465],{"start":462,"end":463,"type":375,"data":464},198,219,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":378},{"start":462,"end":463,"type":143},{"type":87,"text":467,"spans":468,"direction":90},"You should also check the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels via airlines.",[469,474,475,479],{"start":470,"end":471,"type":375,"data":472},26,58,{"link_type":36,"url":473,"target":378},"romania.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":470,"end":471,"type":143},{"start":374,"end":476,"type":375,"data":477},90,{"link_type":36,"url":478,"target":378},"romania.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":374,"end":476,"type":143},{"link_type":254},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":333,"version":31,"items":483,"primary":485,"id":501,"slice_type":502,"slice_label":46},[484],{},{"title":486,"bodyText":487,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":20,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":491,"buttonText":122,"buttonLink":492,"image":494},"Customs",[488],{"type":87,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":90},"Save time and effort when you send your international parcel with Evri. There's no need to fill out a separate customs form; simply fill in all the required information online, and we will do the rest.  ",[],true,{"link_type":36,"key":493,"url":121},"2a4306ac-deca-4976-b5dc-b7d650a0f630",{"dimensions":495,"alt":496,"copyright":46,"url":497,"id":498,"edit":499},{"width":78,"height":271},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","romania.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":66,"y":500,"zoom":67,"background":68},2,"feature_banner$209d9bd7-66f6-4a59-8ce6-c6d072da8c11","feature_banner",{"variation":168,"version":31,"items":504,"primary":506,"id":562,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":46},[505],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":507,"CardText":508,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":561,"IsEco":20},"Address format for shipping to Romania",[509,512,515,518,521,524,527,530,533,538,543,547,551,555,558],{"type":87,"text":510,"spans":511,"direction":90},"There are several differences when writing an address on a parcel   to Romania compared to a UK address. ",[],{"type":87,"text":513,"spans":514,"direction":90},"You’ll need to use the following format:",[],{"type":151,"text":516,"spans":517,"direction":90},"Recipient name",[],{"type":151,"text":519,"spans":520,"direction":90},"Street name and house number",[],{"type":151,"text":522,"spans":523,"direction":90},"Postcode followed by the village and town ",[],{"type":151,"text":525,"spans":526,"direction":90},"County or sector",[],{"type":151,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":90},"ROMANIA",[],{"type":87,"text":531,"spans":532,"direction":90},"For example:",[],{"type":87,"text":534,"spans":535,"direction":90},"Mr J. Bloggs",[536],{"start":66,"end":537,"type":143},12,{"type":87,"text":539,"spans":540,"direction":90},"Str. Florilor 35 ",[541],{"start":66,"end":542,"type":143},17,{"type":87,"text":544,"spans":545,"direction":90},"012345 Bucuresti",[546],{"start":66,"end":233,"type":143},{"type":87,"text":548,"spans":549,"direction":90},"Sector 1",[550],{"start":66,"end":189,"type":143},{"type":87,"text":528,"spans":552,"direction":90},[553],{"start":66,"end":554,"type":143},7,{"type":87,"text":556,"spans":557,"direction":90},"You should also include the block, entrance, floor and\u002For apartment on the second line if necessary.",[],{"type":87,"text":559,"spans":560,"direction":90},"But don’t worry, all you need to do is enter the right address information at checkout, and we’ll make sure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label.",[],{"link_type":254},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":333,"version":31,"items":564,"primary":613,"id":615,"slice_type":616,"slice_label":46},[565,601],{"questionTitle":566,"questionBody":567},"Is there import tax from the UK to Romania?",[568,571,580,583,586,589,592],{"type":262,"text":569,"spans":570,"direction":90},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":87,"text":572,"spans":573,"direction":90},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[574,579],{"start":575,"end":576,"type":375,"data":577},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":578,"target":378},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":575,"end":576,"type":143},{"type":87,"text":581,"spans":582,"direction":90},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":262,"text":584,"spans":585,"direction":90},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":87,"text":587,"spans":588,"direction":90},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":87,"text":590,"spans":591,"direction":90},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":87,"text":593,"spans":594,"direction":90},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[595,600],{"start":596,"end":597,"type":375,"data":598},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":599,"target":378},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":596,"end":597,"type":143},{"questionTitle":602,"questionBody":603},"Can I track my international parcels",[604],{"type":87,"text":605,"spans":606,"direction":90},"Yes. You can track your international Evri parcels throughout their journey to Romania. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on our international tracking page.",[607,612],{"start":608,"end":609,"type":375,"data":610},144,171,{"link_type":36,"url":611,"target":378},"romania.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":608,"end":609,"type":143},{"title":614},"FAQs about shipping to Romania","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,96,125,167,256,332,363,452,482,503,563],["Reactive",619],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":620,"$sclients":686,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":689},{"abtasty":621,"accessibe":624,"appPromoBanner":627,"autoDivertUpdates":630,"awin":633,"bulkInternational":636,"bulkSendEnabled":639,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":642,"enableBasketCount":645,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":648,"euCustomsDuty":651,"groovyAdvert":654,"newInternationalSendFlow":657,"newinternationalpages":664,"oohPreferenceFlag":668,"opentel":671,"prem